==History==
2025
*The Golden Knight [[:Category:Merge Tactics Troop Cards|troop]] was added with [[Merge Tactics]]' launch in the [[Version_History#2025 Quarter 2 Update (30/6/2025)|2025 Quarter 2 Update]] on 30/6/2025, belonging to the {{Trait|Noble}} and {{Trait|Assassin}} [[:Category:Cards by Trait|traits]].
*On 29/9/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 3 Update (29/9/2025)|2025 Quarter 3 Update]] increased the Golden Knight's Damage by 0.72% and his Hitpoints by 0.76%. It also made {{Trait|Assassin}} have bonus effects for 2 and 4 {{Trait|Assassin}} troops and made {{Trait|Noble}} have bonus effects for 6 {{Trait|Noble}} troops, but decreased the 4/4 {{Trait|Noble}} Damage Reduction/Increase to 30% (from 40%) and removed {{Trait|Noble}}'s effects to non-{{Trait|Noble}} troops.
*On 15/10/2025, a [[Version History#Merge Tactics Balance Changes (15/10/2025)|Balance Update]] increased the {{Trait|Noble}} Damage Reduction/Increase to 25%/40%/60% (from 20%/30%/45%). It also decreased the 4/4 {{Trait|Assassin}} Critical Chance and Critical Damage to 45% (from 50%).
*On 3/11/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/11/2025)|Balance Update]] made Golden Knight able to only dash to up to 3 [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] in one round.

